1	//! Builds a verdaccio-shaped `storage` directory in a `TempDir` for the
2	//! static-serve tests. The packuments carry the rich publish metadata a real
3	//! verdaccio/npm registry emits (`_attachments`, `_uplinks`, `_distfiles`,
4	//! `users`, per-version `_nodeVersion`, `_id`, `contributors`) so the tests can
5	//! assert that pnpr rewrites tarball URLs and strips those fields in
6	//! the abbreviated packument form. No real tarball is needed — the bytes are
7	//! arbitrary; nothing re-hashes them.
